face_recognition_sface_2021dec_int8.onnx is the int8-quantized SFace face recognition model from OpenCV Zoo
(https://github.com/opencv/opencv_zoo/tree/main/models/face_recognition_sface), a MobileFaceNet trained with the SFace loss
(Zhong et al., https://github.com/zhongyy/SFace), Apache License 2.0. Input 1x3x112x112 RGB 0..255, output a 128-number vector.
